out.push(A('**B  Listening.**   **1** **twenty-six**   **2** **forty**   **3** **threaten**   **4** **file**   **5** **list**   **6** **head of school**   **7** **separate**   **8** **refusals**'));
out.push(A('⚠ **Part 2 is sentence completion and the words are in the recording: the marks are lost by candidates who paraphrase or who write more than the gap can hold.** **At 3 accept only _threaten_ or _threaten her_** — **the speaker says _the difficult ones are the ones who threaten_, and candidates who write _take it further_ have heard the next sentence and answered with the example rather than the act.** ⚠ **At 4 accept only _file_**: _almost nobody asked me what a complete file needed_, **and _form_ is wrong because the sentence in the paper says _a complete ______ needed_ and the speaker says _file_.** **At 6 accept _head of school_ or _head_; at 7 accept only _separate_.** **At 8 accept _refusals_** — **and candidates who write _decisions_ have understood the sense and lost the mark, which is worth saying out loud, because it is the commonest kind of loss in this part and it has nothing to do with listening.**'));
